#:
#: ``bcb_item_set`` / ``bfcl_item_set`` — the PINNED item set of the leg
#: (:func:`item_set_identity`: ``{seed, n, of, ids_sha256}`` over the pin's ids
#: in pin order), so a store filled under one pin never resumes under a re-pin;
