#: tuples already serve both at 8,192 / 16,384: :data:`G8K_ALL_POSITION_CELLS`), so their MATH-500 tuple is
#: minus_ctl's shape exactly (undeclared, ``served_positions_expected = all``). Launcher spellings; harness ids
