                 "default, MATH500_MAX_TOKENS_DEFAULT), thinking ON, on the cluster full22 battery's serving shape "
                 "(stacked lens reduction, geometry pass 1) — the two EXTRA fitted LoRA cells {model} x {cells} "
                 "(positions: all objects served UNDECLARED, exactly the published minus_ctl cell's shape) under the "
                 "{mode!r} sampling row; a NEW tuple beside the published one because the published stores record "
                 "their tuple BY NAME (`oos_experiment`) and widening `cells` would change that experiment's "
