# landed here as `None` placeholders and were filled from the FINAL contract
# (contract-2.5.md, sha256 prefix 7894fe333f24, 324 lines); every
# constant quotes its value's section. The VOCABULARY literals (`@`, `thinking`,
# `serve_out_of_support`, `serve_experiment`, the token set) are IMPORTED from
# the `serve_declaration` module, never spelled locally.
